{"id":"4797","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4797_main_cirrus-spissatus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图像显示的是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处的密集斑块形式的卷云，其为典型的密云云类。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Stefan Kämpfe","location":"德国图林根州魏玛","latitude":"纬度: 51° 0' 0'' N","longitude":"经度: 11° 0' 0'' E","date":"05 November 2011 1000 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= 8","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.4","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.4"}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4718_main_cirrus-spissatus-mamma-and-cirrus-floccus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>在表面冷锋通路后，是密集的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">密卷云</span>云片。这些云片<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">横向</span>于上层风而对齐，并且还显示出<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">对流发展</span>的迹象，表明它们的水平不稳定。在发展的初始阶段，一种独特的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">带有尾迹的絮状卷云云片</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">絮状卷云</span>证实了这一点。一些不明显的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">乳房状云</span>更说明了这一点。</p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Frank Le Blancq","location":"泽西岛圣布雷拉德","latitude":"纬度: 49° 10' 12'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 10' 9'' W","date":"22 June 2015 1954 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 2","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.4","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.4"}]}]}